# Notices

## What this repository contains

`steamverify` ships **hashes and metadata only**. No game code, no game
assets, and no copyrighted content of any kind is included or redistributed.

The bundled files under `manifests/` contain, for each supported game:

* relative file paths,
* byte sizes,
* SHA-1 digests of file contents and of SteamPipe chunks.

This is the same class of information Steam stores in its own client caches
and distributes to every Steam client that installs a game, and that Steam
exposes through its public depot manifest endpoints. It cannot be used to
reconstruct any file.

